    "homepage": "https://wordpress.org/themes/flex-education/",
    "sections": {
        "description": "The Flex Education and Repair Shop Theme is a versatile solution designed for educational institutions and repair businesses seeking a professional online presence. For education, it is ideal for schools, colleges, universities, coaching institutes, training centers, e-learning platforms, kindergartens, academies, language schools, online course providers, high schools, and professional training institutes. It includes a prominent banner section, course grid layouts, custom post types, and a latest blog area for academic news, study tips, or events. Fully responsive and mobile-friendly, the theme ensures seamless browsing across all devices, and built-in customization options allow control over layouts, colors, and styles without coding. For repair businesses, it showcases express laptop repair, affordable gadget repair, certified repair services, touchscreen repair, laptop fan replacement, circuit board repair, phone sensor repair, tablet camera repair, network issue repair, and Wi-Fi troubleshooting. Dedicated sections for online repair bookings, service descriptions, customer testimonials, and marketing promotions help build trust and attract clients. Optimized for SEO and fast-loading, it integrates smoothly with LearnPress, Advanced Custom Fields, and Contact Form 7, enhancing course management, content flexibility, student engagement, and client inquiries. Perfect for educators, institutions, independent repair centers, or service providers, this theme delivers a professional, lightweight, and feature-rich solution for both educational and repair websites."
    },
